    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 35,
    "summary": "David complains of his enemies and their wrong dealings—He asks the Lord to judge him according to his righteousness.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Plead my cause, O Lord, with them that strive with me: fight against them that fight against me.",
