        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:1",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Take hold of shield and buckler, and stand up for mine help.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:2",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Draw out also the spear, and stop the way against them that persecute me: say unto my soul, I am thy salvation.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 41
          },
          {
            "start": 94,
            "end": 96
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:3",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Let them be confounded and put to shame that seek after my soul: let them be turned back and brought to confusion that devise my hurt.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:4",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Let them be as chaff before the wind: and let the angel of the Lord chase them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 74,
            "end": 79
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Let their way be dark and slippery: and let the angel of the Lord persecute them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 75,
            "text": "HEB pursue."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "For without cause have they hid for me their net in a pit, which without cause they have digged for my soul.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 51
          },
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 64
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Let destruction come upon him at unawares; and let his net that he hath hid catch himself: into that very destruction let him fall.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And my soul shall be joyful in the Lord: it shall rejoice in his salvation.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "TG Joy."
          },
          {
            "start": 65,
            "end": 74,
            "text": "TG Salvation."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
