        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:14",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "But in mine adversity they rejoiced, and gathered themselves together: yea, the abjects gathered themselves together against me, and I knew it not; they did tear me, and ceased not:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "TG Adversity."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 71,
            "end": 75
          },
          {
            "start": 140,
            "end": 142
          },
          {
            "start": 162,
            "end": 165
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Adversity.",
            "prettyString": "TG Adversity",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Adversity",
                "entryId": "tg-adversity",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:15",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "With hypocritical mockers in feasts, they gnashed upon me with their teeth.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "TG Mocking."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Mocking.",
            "prettyString": "TG Mocking",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Mocking",
                "entryId": "tg-mocking",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:16",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "Lord, how long wilt thou look on? rescue my soul from their destructions, my darling from the lions.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "D&C 121:2 (1–6)."
          },
          {
            "start": 77,
            "end": 84,
            "text": "HEB only life."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:17",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "I will give thee thanks in the great congregation: I will praise thee among much people.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:18",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "Let not them that are mine enemies wrongfully rejoice over me: neither let them wink with the eye that hate me without a cause.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 103,
            "end": 107,
            "text": "TG Hate."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 63,
            "end": 70
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Hate.",
            "prettyString": "TG Hate",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Hate",
                "entryId": "tg-hate",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:19",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "For they speak not peace: but they devise deceitful matters against them that are quiet in the land.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 68,
            "end": 81
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:20",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, they opened their mouth wide against me, and said, Aha, aha, our eye hath seen it.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 46,
            "end": 49
          },
          {
            "start": 84,
            "end": 87
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:21",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "This thou hast seen, O Lord: keep not silence: O Lord, be not far from me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:22",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "Stir up thyself, and awake to my judgment, even unto my cause, my God and my Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 26,
            "text": "Ps. 59:4."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 47
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Ps. 59:4.",
            "prettyString": "Psalms 59:4",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "psalms",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 59,
                    "end": 59,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 4,
                        "end": 4
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:23",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "Judge me, O Lord my God, according to thy righteousness; and let them not rejoice over me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:24",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "Let them not say in their hearts, Ah, so would we have it: let them not say, We have swallowed him up.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:25",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
        "text": "Let them be ashamed and brought to confusion together that rejoice at mine hurt: let them be clothed with shame and dishonour that magnify themselves against me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 139,
            "end": 149
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 26,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 35:26",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 26
      },
      {
        "text": "Let them shout for joy, and be glad, that favour my righteous cause: yea, let them say continually, Let the Lord be magnified, which hath pleasure in the prosperity of his servant.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 138,
            "end": 146,
            "text": "TG Pleasure."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 27,
        "crossReferences": [
